      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-580-595"><rb>父</rb><rt>ちゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-595-627">ぎみはしはぶき二つ、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-627-642"><rb>母</rb><rt>はゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-642-660">ぎみはそよ一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-660-681"><rb>雫</rb><rt>しづく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-681-686">、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-686-704"><rb>瀬戸</rb><rt>せど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-704-713">の海、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-713-731"><rb>東</rb><rt>ひがし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-731-745">をさしし</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-745-763"><rb>三日</rb><rt>みか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-763-797">まへに我を見ましぬ。</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-797-815"><rb>世馴</rb><rt>よな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-815-850">れざる野がくれわらべ、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-850-877"><rb>手文筥</rb><rt>てふばこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-877-880">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-880-895"><rb>封</rb><rt>ふう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-895-915">じもあへず、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-915-924">ゐざり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-924-936"><rb>出</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-936-939">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-939-957"><rb>閾</rb><rt>しきゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-957-960">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-960-975"><rb>端</rb><rt>はし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-975-980">の</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-980-998"><rb>柱</rb><rt>はしら</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-998-1010"><rb>抱</rb><rt>だ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1010-1013">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1013-1031"><rb>面</rb><rt>おもて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1031-1050">かくしぬ。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1050-1065">いとほしや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1065-1080"><rb>小</rb><rt>ちさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1080-1083">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1083-1110"><rb>学生</rb><rt>がくしやう</rt></ruby></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1112-1127">いくとせを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1127-1145"><rb>東</rb><rt>あづま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1145-1148">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1148-1166"><rb>京</rb><rt>きやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1166-1171">の</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1171-1186"><rb>旅</rb><rt>たび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1186-1189">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1189-1201"><rb>寝</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1201-1204">ね</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1204-1219"><rb>旅</rb><rt>たび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1219-1236">にねざめて</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1236-1251"><rb>文</rb><rt>ふみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1251-1288">のわざいそしまむとや。</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1288-1303"><rb>口</rb><rt>くち</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1303-1318"><rb>軽</rb><rt>かろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1318-1321">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1321-1336"><rb>胸</rb><rt>むね</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1336-1351"><rb>冷</rb><rt>ひや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1351-1363">やけき </seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1363-1390"><rb>旅館女</rb><rt>はたごめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1390-1413">の待遇ぶりに、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1413-1428"><rb>慨</rb><rt>なげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1428-1440">きては、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1440-1455"><rb>雨</rb><rt>あめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1455-1458">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1458-1476"><rb>夕</rb><rt>ゆうべ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1476-1481">の</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1481-1496"><rb>欄</rb><rt>らん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1496-1536">に、おゝ、何のおもひで。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1536-1571">いとほし、と涙もろに、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1571-1586">叔母ぎみは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1586-1616"><rb>守袋</rb><rt>まもりぶくろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1616-1621">を</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1621-1662">てづからにやさしうかけて、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1662-1668">わが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1668-1683"><rb>背</rb><rt>せな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1683-1692">をそと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1692-1704"><rb>撫</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1704-1723">でましぬ。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1723-1735">をりから</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1735-1753"><rb>車</rb><rt>くるま</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1753-1774"><rb>気近</rb><rt>けぢか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1774-1782">う、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1782-1806"><rb>婢女</rb><rt>はしため</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1806-1809">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1809-1821"><rb>荷</rb><rt>に</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1821-1847">をとゝのふれば、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1847-1882">父ぎみはいとおごそかに</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1882-1897"><rb>健</rb><rt>けん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1897-1931">なれ、とそれよ一言。</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1931-1946"><rb>母</rb><rt>はゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1946-1955">ぎみよ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1955-1973"><rb>乳母</rb><rt>うば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1973-1976">よ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1976-1994"><rb>叔母</rb><rt>をば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1994-2005">ぎみ、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2005-2029"><rb>朝露</rb><rt>あさつゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2029-2035">に五</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2035-2053"><rb>町</rb><rt>てふ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2053-2065"><rb>濡</rb><rt>ぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2065-2076">れ来て</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2076-2091">さらばよの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2091-2115"><rb>御声</rb><rt>おんこゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2115-2129">ごえや、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2129-2167">やわらかにその尾をいきて</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2167-2173">野の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2173-2188"><rb>鶏</rb><rt>とり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2188-2209">の声も流れつ。</seg></p>
    </body>
